.TH SDL_PLATFORM_WINDOWS 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_PLATFORM_WINDOWS \- A preprocessor macro that is only defined if compiling for Windows.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_platform_defines.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_PLATFORM_WINDOWS 1
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This also covers several other platforms, like Microsoft GDK, Xbox, WinRT, etc\[char46] Each will have their own more-specific platform macros, too\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This macro is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

